  {
   "parameters": {
    "content": "## No-Show Shield 2: YES / NO reply capture\nPoint your Twilio number's incoming-message webhook here. YES confirms the next upcoming booking, NO cancels it and starts the waitlist offer, anything else is forwarded to you.\n\n**Setup**\n1. In Twilio, set your number's \"A message comes in\" webhook (HTTP POST) to this workflow's Production URL.\n2. Create a Google Sheet with tabs Bookings, Waitlist and Report using the CSV headers in the sheet-templates folder; paste its ID into the Config node (sheetId).\n3. Fill in the Config node: business name, owner email, time zone offset (for example -05:00), channel (sms or email) and your own Stripe/PayPal payment link.\n4. Attach credentials on nodes with a warning icon: Google Sheets OAuth2, SMTP, and Twilio (HTTP Basic Auth: Account SID / Auth Token) if you use SMS.\n5. Execute once with test rows, then activate.",
    "height": 300,
    "width": 420
   },
